### ============================================================================
### RAKT SANCHAR — Local Demo API Requests (Stub Identity Headers)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080 (Started with SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=demo)
### No passwords or tokens required; DevStubCurrentUserProvider reads:
###   X-Demo-User-Id: <userId>
###   X-Demo-Role: DONOR | HOSPITAL | ADMIN
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Public Platform Statistics (No Identity Required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/public
Accept: application/json

### 2. Public Blood Stock Search (Verified Hospitals Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock?bloodGroup=O%2B&city=Mumbai
Accept: application/json

### 3. Public Verified Hospital Directory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals?city=Mumbai&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 4. Public Eligible Donor Directory (Phone Numbers Masked: ******3210)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/donors?bloodGroup=O%2B&city=Mumbai&eligibleOnly=true&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 5. Acting User Identity & Language Preference (Donor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
X-Demo-User-Id: donor-1
X-Demo-Role: DONOR
Accept: application/json

### 6. Switch Preferred Language to Hindi (hi)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/language
X-Demo-User-Id: donor-1
X-Demo-Role: DONOR
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preferredLanguage": "hi"
}

### 7. Donor Self-Service Profile & Eligibility Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/donors/me/summary
X-Demo-User-Id: donor-1
X-Demo-Role: DONOR
Accept: application/json

### 8. Toggle Donor Availability
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/donors/me/availability
X-Demo-User-Id: donor-1
X-Demo-Role: DONOR
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": true
}

### 9. Create Urgent Blood Request (Triggers Matching & In-App Notifications)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
X-Demo-User-Id: donor-4
X-Demo-Role: DONOR
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Vikramaditya Rao",
  "bloodGroup": "O+",
  "units": 2,
  "urgency": "CRITICAL",
  "hospitalName": "City Care Hospital",
  "city": "Mumbai",
  "contactPhone": "9820112233",
  "neededBy": "2026-10-25T18:00:00Z",
  "latitude": 19.0760,
  "longitude": 72.8777,
  "notes": "Emergency cardiac surgery requirement"
}

### 10. Hospital Portal — Get Own Hospital Profile & Stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/me/stock
X-Demo-User-Id: hospital-1
X-Demo-Role: HOSPITAL
Accept: application/json

### 11. Hospital Portal — Update Blood Stock (Triggers Low-Stock Alert if units <= minThreshold)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/me/stock/O-
X-Demo-User-Id: hospital-1
X-Demo-Role: HOSPITAL
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "units": 2,
  "minThreshold": 5
}

### 12. Hospital Portal — Record Verified Donation Directly (Awards Badges & Updates Last Donation Date)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospitals/me/donations
X-Demo-User-Id: hospital-1
X-Demo-Role: HOSPITAL
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "donorUserId": "donor-1",
  "units": 1,
  "donatedAt": "2026-10-18"
}

### 13. Admin Verification Queue — List Pending Hospitals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/hospitals?status=PENDING
X-Demo-User-Id: admin-1
X-Demo-Role: ADMIN
Accept: application/json

### 14. In-App Notifications for Current Demo User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?page=0&size=20
X-Demo-User-Id: donor-1
X-Demo-Role: DONOR
Accept: application/json
